Synthesis
  1. The old near-blockers are scalar ramps with a single divisor jump, not generic obstructions.
  2. In the exact n=14 full-cell system, radius-1 scalar punctures leave at least 56 witnesses;
     radius-2 punctures leave at least 112.  The scalar line has a visible moat.
  3. The n=14 moat is organized as seven odd s-layers times eight alpha-cells, with
     total alpha width 7/858 for the zero-ramp representative.
  4. Random and hand-built gated speed sets again leaked by positive gaps or boundary witnesses.
  5. Next proof target: prove the scalar-puncture moat symbolically, then combine it with
     endpoint descent so any putative blocker must be far from every scalar ramp and still core-free.
